            <div type="translation" xml:lang="en" resp="#AA">
                <p>
                    To Lucius Cartilius Crescens, sevir Augustalis, member of the worshippers of the divine house, honoured without payment, from the most splendid order of council of Mediolanum,
                    with confirmation by Sabucius Maior, most eminent man and curator of the state.
                    Lucius Valerius Primitivus and Catia Severa, with their son Gaius Ancerius Tintirio, [dedicated this] on account of his merits, to an excellent friend. To the Genius.
                </p>
            </div>
